resources.string:
Portions of the App's content — including but not limited to narrative summaries, daily digests, and interpretive text accompanying charts and indicators — are generated using artificial intelligence / machine learning models. This content:
• has not been individually reviewed or verified by a human before being shown to you;
• may be incomplete, inaccurate, outdated, or misleading;
• may occasionally state something incorrectly with apparent confidence.
Always cross-check AI-generated content against the underlying data and independent sources before relying on it in any way.
